{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/state/url-state","title":"URL state: queryParams and pathParams","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"url-state-queryparams-and-pathparams","children":[{"t":"text","text":"URL state: "},{"t":"code","text":"queryParams"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"pathParams"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"queryParams"},{"t":"text","text":" is a state whose home is the URL's query string. Reading and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"writing look like any other state; the address bar follows, and so does the back"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"button."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use it when"}]},{"t":"text","text":" the value should survive a refresh and be shareable by copying"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the link: filters, pagination, a selected tab."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Not when"}]},{"t":"text","text":" the value is ephemeral or private — that's"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/state/local-state","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"state"}]},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"callout","tone":"tip","caption":"No synchronisation code","children":[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"There is no effect to write and no "},{"t":"code","text":"ActivatedRoute"},{"t":"text","text":" subscription. If you find"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"yourself syncing a "},{"t":"code","text":"state"},{"t":"text","text":" with the URL, you want this primitive instead."}]}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-common-case","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The common case"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { queryParams } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/core'","kind":"punctuation"